#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:7
#: 79a3f76b514a4379bc3b788498d1430e
msgid ""
"This page shows how to setup ROS 2 with ArduPilot SITL and run Google "
"Cartographer as a SLAM source."
msgstr "本页介绍如何配置 ROS 2 与 ArduPilot SITL，并将 Google Cartographer 作为 SLAM 数据源运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:10
#: 8e3778cda1f946f3a34229169da278ca
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:12
#: ad4e8247d83443a5898327b4253d7627
msgid ""
"This page assumes that you've successfully followed the ROS 2 basic setups "
"from this wiki: :ref:`ROS 2 <ros2>`, :ref:`ROS 2 with SITL <ros2-sitl>` and "
":ref:`ROS 2 with gazebo <ros2-gazebo>`."
msgstr ""
"本页假设您已成功完成本 wiki 中的 ROS 2 基础配置：:ref:`ROS 2 <ros2>`、:ref:`ROS 2 与 SITL "
"<ros2-sitl>` 以及 :ref:`ROS 2 与 Gazebo <ros2-gazebo>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:14
#: f03409b6c6224cd5a0405384e61fc42e
msgid "Once that's done, simply run:"
msgstr "完成上述配置后，直接运行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:26
#: 8f4f8ce48ba4477bad97e67441dc56aa
msgid "Now source your workspace and build `ardupilot_ros`:"
msgstr "现在激活您的工作空间并构建 `ardupilot_ros`："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:35
#: 4cef3062982c4099951262f28fd196fa
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:37
#: 1b9014685b2945f7b1802d97855ad0cc
msgid ""
"This package is used in combination with `ardupilot_gz`, first we will "
"launch a simulation containing a copter equipped with a 360 degress 2D lidar"
" in a maze world. To launch rviz and gazebo, run:"
msgstr ""
"此软件包与 `ardupilot_gz` 配合使用，首先我们将在迷宫世界中启动一个搭载 360 度 2D 激光雷达的多旋翼仿真器。要启动 rviz 和 "
"Gazebo，请运行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:45
#: 848acc555dae4e2582b415f310e2206c
msgid ""
"Now, we can launch Google Cartographer to generate SLAM, check if a map is "
"being generated correctly in RVIZ. In another terminal, run:"
msgstr "现在，我们可以启动 Google Cartographer 来生成 SLAM，在 RVIZ 中检查地图是否正确生成。在另一个终端中运行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:54
#: 7c27f0db150044e48934cb7211b4f795
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:56
#: 036a82e3410c4ebfaeed088ef2bb2ecd
msgid ""
"If you'd like to get the information from Cartographer to go into "
"ArduPilot's extended kalman filter, you will need to change some parameters,"
" you can do that through any GCS, including mavproxy:"
msgstr ""
"如果您希望将 Cartographer 的信息输入到 ArduPilot 的扩展卡尔曼滤波器中，则需要修改一些参数，可通过任何地面控制站（包括 "
"mavproxy）进行设置："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:58
#: 283c736b79bb4367af023b716a4499b8
msgid ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <copter:AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 3 to use EKF3"
msgstr ":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <copter:AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 3，使用 EKF3"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:59
#: 620208782b4042ab863330671190cc15
msgid ":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <copter:EK2_ENABLE>` = 0 to disable EKF2"
msgstr ":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <copter:EK2_ENABLE>` = 0，禁用 EKF2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:60
#: c31b05c862bd4cd8b9fa6fe78ac10ddd
msgid ":ref:`EK3_ENABLE <copter:EK3_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable EKF3"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_ENABLE <copter:EK3_ENABLE>` = 1，启用 EKF3"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:61
#: 3c2d3dac01944281850d7d53685b8af3
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6 to set position horizontal"
" source to ExternalNAV"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6，将水平位置来源设为 ExternalNAV"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:62
#: fdebbfaf9dff4de3a5cdd5ac904bcc29
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1 to set position vertical "
"source to Baro"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1，将垂直位置来源设为气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:63
#: f936732d770b4907af9e98505dda6dae
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6 to set velocity horizontal"
" source to ExternalNAV"
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6，将水平速度来源设为 ExternalNAV"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:64
#: b3a38f9b717343cdbd757d4feb8266e7
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6 to set vertical velocity "
"source to ExternalNAV"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <copter:EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6，将垂直速度来源设为 ExternalNAV"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:65
#: fe3ce0deb56842d78eacb17e7654a3d7
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <copter:EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6 to set yaw source to "
"ExternalNAV"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <copter:EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6，将偏航来源设为 ExternalNAV"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:66
#: ec725577b8584ad8bd8252e396c3fee9
msgid ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <copter:VISO_TYPE>` = 1 to enable visual odometry"
msgstr ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <copter:VISO_TYPE>` = 1，启用视觉里程计"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:67
#: 09578411601a40eba07a768eb3f45d83
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK <copter:ARMING_CHECK>` = 388598 (optional, to disable GPS"
" checks)"
msgstr ":ref:`ARMING_CHECK <copter:ARMING_CHECK>` = 388598（可选，用于禁用 GPS 检查）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:70
#: c0f9d7bb1e7f4cbd8c6746a7d7da63e0
msgid "After changing the values above, reboot the flight controller."
msgstr "更改上述参数后，重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:73
#: 024f9a555b7d4642802f6f09eb8de18d
msgid ""
"The parameters above are recommended for SITL. If you plan on using this on "
"a real copter, it is a good idea to setup a second source of EKF. This way "
"the robot doesn't crash if the external odometry you are providing stops "
"publishing or gets lost."
msgstr ""
"以上参数推荐用于 SITL。如果您计划在真实飞机上使用，建议配置第二个 EKF 数据源，这样即使您提供的外部里程计停止发布或丢失，飞机也不会坠毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-cartographer-slam.rst:75
#: d18ebcbd61a2445d837b2e119dbb802b
msgid ""
"Please refer to this link for more information on `Common EKF Sources "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-ekf-sources.html>`__ as well as "
"this guide on `GPS / Non-GPS Transitions "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"请参阅此链接了解更多关于 `常用 EKF 数据源 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-ekf-"
"sources.html>`__ 的信息，以及关于 `GPS / 非 GPS 切换 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.html>`__ 的指南。"

